---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { images } from '../data/assets';
---
<BaseLayout title="Trekking & Active Group Travel | Talon Expeditions" description="Supported trekking, hiking, mountain and active group travel for clubs, communities and private groups worldwide." image={images.trekking}>
  <section class="page-hero" style={`background-image:url('${images.trekking}')`}><div class="shell"><p class="eyebrow">Trekking & active travel</p><h1 class="section-title">Journeys built around moving through the place, not just looking at it.</h1><p>Supported hiking, trekking, mountain, and active travel with the logistics and preparation organized around your group.</p></div></section>
  <section class="section"><div class="shell content-split"><aside class="side-card"><p class="eyebrow">Active group planning</p><h2>Tell us what challenge feels right.</h2><p>We can shape route, pacing, support, accommodation, and preparation around the group.</p><a class="button" href="/contact/">Plan an Active Trip</a></aside><div class="prose"><h2>Active does not have to mean extreme.</h2><p>Some groups want a hard objective. Others want long days outside followed by a comfortable evening. The useful question is not whether a trip is adventurous enough. It is whether the activity, pace, support, and environment fit the people traveling.</p><h3>Trip directions</h3><ul><li>Hiking and multi-day trekking</li><li>Peaks and mountain journeys</li><li>Beginner-friendly active itineraries</li><li>Expedition-style trekking</li><li>Active cultural travel</li><li>Preparation and training support</li></ul><h3>Group readiness matters</h3><p>For more active journeys, preparation is part of the trip. We help clarify fitness expectations, equipment, pacing, and what participants should do before departure.</p></div></div></section>
</BaseLayout>
